--- .gitignore (原始)
```
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.so
.coverage
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Test reports and outputs
test_output_raw.txt
tests/reports/
tests/__pycache__/

# Distribution / packaging
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*
.env~*
.venv/
venv/
ENV/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```

+++ .gitignore (修改后)
Nothing needs to be added to .gitignore since the only change is adding a test Python file (`tests/test_documentation_compliance.py`), which is source code and should not be ignored.